<div class="execution-path-strip execution-path-strip--three" role="region" aria-label="Space members and connected Workspaces">
  <div class="execution-path-step">
    <span>01 · People</span>
    <strong>Join in the browser</strong>
    <p>Invited members open the Space in Syntila to talk, ask the Space's AI Workers, or just read along.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="execution-path-step">
    <span>02 · Shared Space</span>
    <strong>Threads and permissions</strong>
    <p>The Space keeps each topic in its own Thread and records which Workers its members are allowed to use.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="execution-path-step">
    <span>03 · A member's computer</span>
    <strong>Where the AI runs</strong>
    <p>Syntila Workspace runs the AI tools installed there. The provider logins stay on that computer and are never shown to other members.</p>
  </div>
